{"overview":"فیلم ماجرای یک مرد نویسنده است که با خروج از شهر، به ویلایش در شمال پناه می‌برد و پس از ورود به ویلا، پرده‌ها را می‌کشد و ارتباط خود را با دنیای بیرون قطع می‌کند. در حالی که به دنبال آن یک مرد و زن جوان که در حال فرار از دست پلیس هستند، ناگهان وارد خانه می‌شوند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In a secluded house by the sea with the curtains shut, a screenwriter hides from the world with only his dog as company. The tranquility is abruptly broken one night by the arrival of a young woman fleeing from the authorities. Refusing to leave, she takes refuge in the house. But come dawn, another unexpected presence will change everything.","tagline_en":"","runtime":106,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Kambuzia Partovi","جعفر پناهی"],"crew_en":["Kambuzia Partovi","Jafar Panahi"],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"Kambuzia Partovi","role":"The Writer","photo":"/vgo3LLcX84oKdQeavunqgFyDPOs.jpg"},{"name":"مریم مقدم","role":"Melika","photo":"/dbJhNz5R0ff8NC4bvkSdg0Tlcka.jpg","en":"Maryam Moghaddam"},{"name":"جعفر پناهی","role":"Jafar Panahi","photo":"/viZZkkfcuWze68bvUiMZmYZe8Qg.jpg","en":"Jafar Panahi"},{"name":"Hadi Saeedi","role":"Melika's Brother","photo":""},{"name":"Azadeh Torabi","role":"Melika's Sister","photo":""},{"name":"Abolghasem Sobhani","role":"Agha Olia","photo":""},{"name":"Mahyar Jafaripour","role":"Younger Brother","photo":""},{"name":"Ramin Akhariani","role":"Worker","photo":""},{"name":"Sina Mashyekhi","role":"Worker","photo":""},{"name":"Siamak Abedinpour","role":"Worker","photo":""},{"name":"Zeynab Kanoum","role":"Herself","photo":""},{"name":"Boy","role":"Boy the Dog","photo":"/y9kITHp4fAfZJWL659na5CJyChB.jpg"}],"trailer":"iij9UFuAnog","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/160171-prdh/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Kanopy","kind":"free","logo":"/cltb8XKan9ierp23ItPmCOcVLRa.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/160171-prdh/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"MUBI","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/k7iSl